<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">rally</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">rally</ansi> command calls out an inspiring shout that
steadies the defenses of you and your allies. All friendly
characters in the room receive a temporary bonus to their
ability to dodge, parry, and block incoming attacks.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requirements:</ansi>

  - Cannot be used if special move cooldown is active

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">rally</ansi>
  Shout an inspiring call to bolster defenses

<ansi fg="yellow">Affects:</ansi>

  - You (the caster)
  - Your companions in the room
  - Party members in the room and their companions

<ansi fg="yellow">Mechanics:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="stat">Effect:</ansi> Improves dodge, parry, and block
  <ansi fg="stat">Duration:</ansi> Moderate
  <ansi fg="stat">Scaling:</ansi> Rhetoric skill and Charisma
  <ansi fg="stat">Cooldown:</ansi> Shared with bash, trip, kick, and taunt
  <ansi fg="stat">Skill:</ansi> Progresses Rhetoric and Charisma

Rally can be used before combat begins, making it useful
for pre-buffing before engaging a tough enemy. Higher Rhetoric
skill and Charisma increase the potency of the effect.

<ansi fg="yellow">See Also:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">help warcry</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help rhetoric</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help combat</ansi>
